flowchart TD
    V[Reference Video] --> F[Physical / Frame Evidence]
    F --> FT[FrameTimeline]
    FT --> EC[Event Clusters]
    EC --> AI[Atomic Action Inventory]
    AI --> DOP[Decision / Operation Projection]
    DOP --> EG[Canonical MOTION.OS TypedEditingGraph]

    AI --> CAP[Caption Grammar]
    AI --> DEP[Depth / Occlusion Grammar]
    AI --> MOT[Motion / Transition Grammar]
    AI --> AUD[Audio / SFX Graph]
    AI --> RET[Retention / Stimulus Grammar]

    EG --> AE[After Effects Adapter]
    EG --> RM[Remotion Adapter]
    EG --> HF[HyperFrames / GSAP Adapter]

    AE --> RAE[AE Reconstruction]
    RM --> RRM[Remotion Render]
    HF --> RHF[HyperFrames Render]

    RAE --> QA[Frame-Level Fidelity QA]
    RRM --> QA
    RHF --> QA

    QA -->|defect| REPAIR[Graph-Native Repair]
    REPAIR --> EG
    QA -->|pass| GEN[3x Generalization Tests]
    GEN -->|pass| CANON[Canonical Template Library]

    AI -. source-specific .-> SL[SOURCE_LOCK]
    SL -. exact only .-> AE
    SL -. stripped/slotted .-> GEN

    U[UNKNOWN source internals] -. never fabricated .-> QA
